<title>ITALY: Pope returns to Rome after Polish pilgrimage.</title>
<headline>Pope returns to Rome after Polish pilgrimage.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pope John Paul returned to Rome on Tuesday at the end of an 11-day pilgrimage to his Polish homeland.</p>
<p>The Polish LOT airlines plane carrying the Pope and his entourage landed at Rome's Ciampino airport at around 9.10 p.m. local time (1910 GMT).</p>
</text>
